+#                                   0.5 = talks half as often, 2.0 = twice as often, capped at 100%)
+#   num_predict_override    INT   - per-personality response token cap (NULL/0 = use OllamaChat.NumPredict)
+#   temperature_override    FLOAT - per-personality sampling temperature (NULL = use OllamaChat.Temperature;
